2026-07-27T08:59:49.9199968Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:59:49.9200570Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:59:49.9201500Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:59:49.9202403Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:59:49.9203573Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:59:49.9204497Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
